@startuml autonomous-service-capability-boundary
title Autonomous Service vs Autonomous Capability Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Capability" as acap
class "Autonomous Service" as autosvc

acap <-- autosvc : supports (where canonical)

note right of acap
  Capability-level autonomy
  (enduring ability)
end note

note right of autosvc
  Service-level autonomous
  realization
end note

note bottom
  Distinct semantic kinds
  per ADR-ES-015 §14
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-003
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-015
end note
@enduml
